VERDICT
  Eq. (6): exponent p-1 correct in d=3 with constant q;
           general d gives p-d+2; variable q adds the prefactor (q_n-1)/(q_n(1-q_n^-p)).
  Eq. (7): exact only for constant q (geometric mesh).
  Closed form: q_k = 1+ln2/k+(ln2)^2/(2k^2)+...; 4q/(1+q)^2 = 1-(ln2)^2/(4k^2)+O(k^-3).
  -> the manuscript's O(k^-4) must be O(k^-3).

